      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "STOMP ROCKER (2) was long overdue after four placings in a row before a deserved win (22.18) last time at this track. Goes very well here finding the frame in each of nine starts. Rates highly here and will go close. VELVET LEGEND (1) was in the placings last time but prior to that clocked a swift 22.89 win over 400m at Gawler. Smart winner two back and looks a key chance on that form. JULIE KEEPING (7) is progressing well with another good run last time, placing (17.22) last time out at this track. Form at the trip excellent including four wins. Expected to be in the finish again. WATCH AND SEE (4) was strongly fancied last time but finished second (19.88), beaten 1.75 lengths.",
